// The plaza where the player wakes up (2 x 2 lots around the spawn, on the start floor; placed by
// the planner, `planner::START_CHUNK`). Open, so the crater ahead (-z) pulls the eye: street
// lights at its corners, a few benches facing the crater, and one armchair with a flower behind
// the curb of the street before it, facing it. Only one, so the secret of the flowers is not
// spelled out from the first step.
